            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Fixed
- **The rest of 0.5.24's fix, for sessions Perch had already saved.** That
  release stopped two same-id sessions from different tools being confused
  while running, but their saved files still shared one name, so one could go
  missing after a restart. Each session now gets its own file, and Perch
  renames what's already on your Mac when it starts. Nothing is lost.
]]></description>
